WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.700
Hello everybody, this is DrewNailer. Today I'm going to show you how to install and configure

00:04.700 --> 00:11.140
DSpellCheck in Notepad++. So if you haven't already, go ahead and open up Notepad++ and

00:11.140 --> 00:16.500
we're going to go to Plugins, Admin, search for DSpellCheck, check the box next to it,

00:16.600 --> 00:21.440
click install, click yes, and then type in your password and then click yes. It'll

00:21.440 --> 00:26.240
install it. And now, as you can see, it's installed. If we try to type something,

00:27.440 --> 00:31.560
it doesn't put the little squiggly line under it. So we need to go to Plugins,

00:32.820 --> 00:37.720
DSpellCheck, Settings, change the library from Hunspell to Native Windows, and then

00:37.720 --> 00:41.800
click OK. And even before I clicked OK, you can see that it changed it right there.

00:41.920 --> 00:47.920
The reason why you would want to do this is Notepad++ seems to not have DSpellCheck

00:47.920 --> 00:54.040
anymore. So I'm using version 7.9.2. I hope this video helped and please

00:54.040 --> 00:58.380
let me know if you need any help with this in the comments below. Thank you for

00:58.380 --> 00:59.240
watching and goodbye.

